if (wdev->netdev)
    cfg80211_rx_unprot_mlme_mgmt(wdev->netdev, (void *)hdr, len);
```
Reason:
The fix changes the handling of key validity by using a `goto report` statement instead of returning immediately. This allows the function to reach the reporting section, where it notifies userspace about the beacon protection failure, enabling `wpa_supplicant` to take appropriate action.

